{"agent":"pperf8","data":{"by":"grok-4.7","evidence":{"chunk_findings":[{"chunk":1,"detail":"JSON answers never name a next call. Given `format=\"json\"`, `run_perf_report` sets `text` to `json.dumps(RT.to_json(report))` only and returns that as the chat body. The intent and [r-tell-dont-discover] require every answer to name the exact next CLI and MCP calls; text/md/svg/html go through `_footer`, json does not, so a machine-readable report is the one form that omits them.","digest":"04065003748659bb","family":"xai","location":"ddflow/api/perfreport.py:140","malformed":"","reviewer":"grok-4.7","severity":"MEDIUM","title":"ddflow/api/perfreport.py:140"},{"chunk":1,"detail":"`svg` writes one file by joining every chart with `\"\\n\\n\".join(charts.values())`. When both gate p90 and model pass-rate rows exist, that is two full SVG documents in `report-<ts>.svg`. Opening that path (the next call the footer tells the user to use) is not a single SVG document, so the file the report just wrote does not render.","digest":"9b5f1935ca97fadc","family":"xai","location":"ddflow/api/perfreport.py:145","malformed":"","reviewer":"grok-4.7","severity":"MEDIUM","title":"ddflow/api/perfreport.py:145"},{"chunk":1,"detail":"SVG/HTML delivery inlines the whole document with no cap: `body = f\"path: {path}\\n{doc}\\n...\"`. The stated remote/shell-less contract is file content inline only up to a bound. A report whose chart HTML/SVG exceeds that bound is still returned in full in `Outcome.text`, so the inline path is unbounded.","digest":"f29bd3b7e3126cb2","family":"xai","location":"ddflow/api/perfreport.py:149","malformed":"","reviewer":"grok-4.7","severity":"MEDIUM","title":"ddflow/api/perfreport.py:149"},{"chunk":1,"detail":"Text and markdown next-calls are built with an empty `out`: `_footer(fmt, \"\", win)` yields `ddflow perf report --format text --window <win> --out ` (and the same MCP form). Copying that exact command fails because `--out`/`out=` is present with no value. SVG/HTML do not have this hole; the default text path does.","digest":"082ecfcd7069fb8a","family":"xai","location":"ddflow/api/perfreport.py:137","malformed":"","reviewer":"grok-4.7","severity":"LOW","title":"ddflow/api/perfreport.py:137"},{"chunk":3,"detail":"The test never reads the JSON body for `--filters phase=P1` (`_out` is discarded) and only checks exit code 0. An implementation that ignores `phase=` and always builds the unfiltered report still passes that assertion; the later `phase=NOPE` check only covers unknown-phase refusal, not that a known phase changes `gates`/`cycle`/`waits`. So the named contract (the filter is honoured) is not falsified by any input this test runs.","digest":"68550a8a05d4a7fe","family":"xai","location":"tests/test_perf_report_surfaces.py:test_report_honours_a_phase_filter","malformed":"","reviewer":"grok-4.7","severity":"MEDIUM","title":"tests/test_perf_report_surfaces.py:test_report_honours_a_phase_filter"}],"chunks_total":3,"coverage":"3/3 chunk(s) reviewed","delta_rounds":0,"diff_chars":19627,"diff_sha":"c98ede6bc26e7524a6debd2e3d798efdd7502d45a32c3edabbd50459d75c48a8","diff_source":"main..HEAD + tracked working-tree changes in $HOME/src/ddflow/.ddflow/worktrees/PM-report-surfaces","diff_stat":{"deletions":0,"files":0,"insertions":0,"untracked":0},"elapsed_s":64.9,"excluded_bytes":4136,"excluded_files":2,"excluded_paths":["tests/golden/__snapshots__/test_golden_cli_help.ambr","tests/golden/__snapshots__/test_golden_mcp_tools.ambr"],"family":"xai","findings":5,"max_chunk_chars":8000,"model":"grok-4.7","output_digest":"74bd7b256bd58743","output_file":".ddflow/local/reviews/PM-report-surfaces.rubber_duck.grok-4.7.20261110T155909Z-f863059a.jsonl","reason":"","review_kind":"full","reviewed":[1,2,3],"reviewed_head":"4960a481f01c586e289819aedd29d28209600082","reviewed_paths":{"ddflow/api/__init__.py":"100644 f11642207c9b8c514f7d382c43af0d94fc2f1827","ddflow/api/perfreport.py":"100644 c1ce664262df8eae598bc6f911ccdc175fb80944","ddflow/config_sections/perf_metrics.py":"100644 ea1547a0cac69dfdecec682ac549e32c6dd1bac0","ddflow/surfaces/declared/perfremote.py":"100644 1abc4245d83e57b51808239d1f8037e506eaf9d6","ddflow/templates/upgrade/unreleased/knob_added.perf_metrics.report_default_window.toml":"100644 fe7efc1b7f981ae0403172426f8724173442a3d5","ddflow/templates/upgrade/unreleased/knob_added.perf_metrics.report_max_rows.toml":"100644 61f9bd5ef88bf8aad433372615b298ef5358aac6","ddflow/templates/upgrade/unreleased/knob_added.perf_metrics.report_width.toml":"100644 1e14e258d3c9a75915b5769e25dd8c8194d3ab0a","tests/golden/__snapshots__/test_golden_cli_help.ambr":"100644 9e8d58997efd24b23dd46d4e838e28e06a4d6ad8","tests/golden/__snapshots__/test_golden_mcp_tools.ambr":"100644 4cacbcfc0c9c81868033d2e661990e763dc380bf","tests/test_perf_report_surfaces.py":"100644 a653748bf0b3619d28fff074566b8d0ec10478b5"},"reviewer":"grok-4.7","reviewer_digest":"1857ec352c55ee94","reviewer_families":["google","xai"],"round":1,"rounds":1,"status":"REVIEWED","titles":["ddflow/api/perfreport.py:140","ddflow/api/perfreport.py:145","ddflow/api/perfreport.py:149","ddflow/api/perfreport.py:137","tests/test_perf_report_surfaces.py:test_report_honours_a_phase_filter"],"tree_sha":"4960a481f01c+clean","unreviewed":[],"waves":1},"gate":"rubber_duck","reason":"5 finding(s)"},"id":"ee3c8a46ba50769f585b0b0c5","kind":"gate.failed","lamport":167229,"schema":1,"subject":"PM-report-surfaces","ts":"2026-11-10T16:00:14.831687Z"}
